  "description": "Complex: the second real client-auth shape — clientAuth body sends client_id/client_secret as form fields instead of a Basic header, with no scope at all. Executes at invoke time (the token is fetched with client_credentials and cached); the hosts in this example are placeholders, so invoking it as-is fails to connect.",
